  "title": "Reasoning effort for AI agent steps",
  "summary": "AI agent steps can now use extended thinking, configured with a model-adaptive reasoning effort dropdown in the provider/model picker. Supported on Anthropic Claude, OpenAI o-series and GPT-5, Azure OpenAI, Google AI Gemini, AWS Bedrock Claude, OpenRouter, DeepSeek, and Mistral, with an explicit off option. Reasoning tokens are billed, and thinking is streamed into a collapsible Thinking box in chat mode.",
